    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **GREY KNIGHTS** as your Army Faction, as the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) of your opponent's turn ends, you may pick units of yours on the battlefield that are outside every enemy unit's Engagement Range and whose models all have this ability. The most you can pick depends on battle size:\n\n- **Incursion**: 2.\n- **Strike Force**: 3.\n- **Onslaught**: 4.\n\nPut the picked units into **[strategic reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**. They may arrive with an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during your next [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), your first turn included.",
